    <title>22. 半年更！“爱”，从“不信永远”到“爱是成全”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a67fef656a3f3491ba5f818</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a67fef656a3f3491ba5f818</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 01:08:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>半年不更新，再见面已是“换了人间”！</span></p><p><span>本期节目超多catch up大料放送。不要错过！</span></p><p></p><p><span>⏱️ Timeline：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="14">0:14</a>&nbsp; 快问快答：爱是酸奶、草莓，还是汤？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="245">4:05</a>&nbsp; “你信爱能永远吗？”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="527">8:47</a>&nbsp; 柯总重磅：怎么就想生孩子了？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1191">19:51</a>&nbsp; 奶总找对象SOP揭秘：三道关卡超实用</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2218">36:58</a>&nbsp; 那些以为“天塌了”的断裂时刻，后来都成了重建的开始</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3326">55:26</a>&nbsp; K总突发：异地3年要领证，户口本还写着“已婚”？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3843">1:04:03</a>&nbsp; 亲密关系是镜子：照见贪嗔痴，也照见藏起来的野心与阴影</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4850">1:20:50</a>&nbsp; 爱是什么？“信仰”，“空气”，还是“成全”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5190">1:26:30</a>&nbsp; 下期预告：8月成都合体，10月产房见！</span></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p><span>💬 留言互动：如果爱是一种食物，你选什么？</span></p><p></p><p><span>【主播】</span><strong><em><span>K</span></em></strong><span>总（白日梦</span><strong><em><span>KIIIIIly</span></em></strong><span>），奶总（李牛奶</span><strong><em><span>19</span></em></strong><span>），柯总（啊柯柯柯）。</span></p><p><span>【剪辑】无凡</span></p><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><p><span>《golden hour》——JVKE</span></p><p><span>《成全》——林宥嘉</span></p>]]></description>
