    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>上传节目的此刻，真不困三人组终于同时回到了成都！</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>这一期让我们聊聊城市、友情与美味。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>❤️ 希望大家可以一边听播客一边吃顿好的！❤️</span></strong></p><p></p><hr><p><span>🎧【快问快答】</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6">00:06</a></span></strong><span> &nbsp;真不困晚餐之选</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="188">03:08</a></span></strong><span> &nbsp;世界末日最想留下的三种食物？</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="308">05:08</a></span></strong><span> &nbsp;吃过最特别的食物？</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="415">06:55</a></span></strong><span> &nbsp;说一道自己的拿手菜！</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="685">11:25</a></span></strong><span> &nbsp;最想尝试或者学做的菜？</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a></span></strong><span> &nbsp;甜咸派、粉脆党，你站哪队？</span></p><p></p><p><span>🎤【展开讲讲】</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1142">19:02</a></span></strong><span> &nbsp;穿梭于城市之间，K总串联起姐妹食堂</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1323">22:03</a></span></strong><span> &nbsp;幸福肥是有理论依据的</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1721">28:41</a></span></strong><span> &nbsp;一个城市的饮食文化能够体现它的商业潜力</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2086">34:46</a></span></strong><span> &nbsp;十种不辣的川菜了解一下</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2309">38:29</a></span></strong><span> &nbsp;一些不具参考性的饮食习惯</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2858">47:38</a></span></strong><span> &nbsp;预制菜是我们的未来吗？</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3279">54:39</a></span></strong><span> &nbsp;吃不到一起，还能在一起吗？</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3932">65:32</a></span></strong><span> &nbsp;梦见“人肉火腿肠”，醒来和食物和解了</span></p><p></p><hr><p><em><span>【主播】</span></em></p><p><strong><em><span>K</span></em></strong><em><span>总（白日梦</span></em><strong><em><span>KIIIIIly</span></em></strong><em><span>），奶总（李牛奶</span></em><strong><em><span>19</span></em></strong><em><span>），柯总（啊柯柯柯）。</span></em></p><p><em><span>【剪辑】无凡</span></em></p><p><em><span>【BGM】</span></em></p><p><em><span>《Stay Alone》-The Screen Tones</span></em></p><p><em><span>《ひやむぎ、そーめん、时々うどん (凉面，素面，有时乌冬面)》-ハムFoxtail-Grass Studio</span></em></p>]]></description>
