  <item>
    <title>12. 发疯也是需要练习的，让我们顶疯相见❗️</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65c23aac513a776b5712c0ea</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65c23aac513a776b5712c0ea</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 06 Feb 2024 13:57:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>「真不困」春节特辑来啦，本期让我们一起聊聊“发疯”这件小事，也许能给听友们应对七大姑八大姨的一些勇气！希望主播们能成为大家的“线上发疯搭子”，一起对抗这个颠坏的世界！期待和大家顶”疯“相见❗️</span></p><span></span><p><span>同时也祝听友们春节快乐！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【快问快答】1.3倍速来了👋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:40</a> 三位主播的疯值排序</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="78">01:18</a> 你觉得自己是越来越疯还是越来越正常</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="103">01:43</a> 选择做天才还是做疯子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="132">02:12</a> 什么情况下容易发疯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a> 哪个虚拟人物让你觉得很疯很喜欢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a> 哪个现实人物让你觉得很疯很喜欢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="395">06:35</a> 发疯时的BGM是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="550">09:10</a> 幻想过自己人格分裂吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="709">11:49</a> 网络和现实的你哪个更疯</span></p><span></span><p><span>【展开讲讲】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="790">13:10</a> 发疯的定义是什么，以及看心理医生真的有用么</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>涉及的心理咨询平台：暂停实验室、简单心理、KnowYourself （无广）</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2009">33:29</a> 发疯也是一种心灵疗愈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2023">33:43</a> 我们为什么要发疯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2279">37:59</a> 发疯的人，整个世界都会为你让路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2558">42:38</a> 应对这个世界，不能只有一种发疯的方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2840">47:20</a> 发疯也是需要训练的：职场发疯实录</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3369">56:09</a> 人生来就有发疯的权利🤪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3580">59:40</a> 2024年运势敲黑板📝：今年很适合发疯❗️</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">01:00:00</a> 和父母之间比较疯的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4390">01:13:10</a> 别人对自己做的发疯的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4921">01:22:01</a> 幻想一件能在平行宇宙里要去发疯的事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5417">01:30:17</a> 如何更好的发疯tips分享</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>【BGM】</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>金蛇狂舞（TRAP FLIP）——Howie Lee</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>Star Wars Main Theme ——John Williams</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>Long Black Night —— 《黑暗荣耀》OST</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>舞舞舞 —— 陈婧霏</span></em></p>]]></description>
