    <guid isPermaLink="false">65b49108a5fe30bcbfc00008</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 27 Jan 2024 05:13:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>「真不困」新年第一期充满了来自友情的正能量——老友记也可以演成复仇者联盟，新年让我们紧紧拥抱友情吧！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>*「快问快答」*</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 你认为男女之间有没有纯友谊？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 在彼此父母心中的印象揭秘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="280">04:40</a> 哪一部电影适合诠释你心目中的友谊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="411">06:51</a> 如果能给好朋友一个超能力，你会给谁？给什么超能力？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>*「展开讲讲」*</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="533">08:53</a> 男女之间到底有没有纯友谊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="995">16:35</a> 有没有好友转爱人的经历？或者友达以上恋人未满的经历？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1670">27:50</a> k总对“好朋友”的几个定义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1867">31:07</a> 自己的朋友不喜欢自己的另一半，是一个很严重的问题么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2471">41:11</a> 奶总分享曼谷演唱会0元购经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2797">46:37</a> 分享朋友做过最让自己感动的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3170">52:50</a> 工作中交到的朋友，能长期留下来的很少</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3420">57:00</a> k总分享维系朋友tips：和朋友发展共同的兴趣爱好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3979">66:19</a> e人社交tips：朋友圈点赞之后，马上私聊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4087">68:07</a> 分享年度之友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4905">81:45</a> 分享理想的友谊设想</span></p>]]></description>
