  <item>
    <title>10. 没有万能解药，仍感激命运牵线搭桥❤️ | 2023年终盘点</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/658f6dbbcab6086ec17db990</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">658f6dbbcab6086ec17db990</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 30 Dec 2023 01:09:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>困友们好！</span></p><span></span><p><span>万万没想到，佛系更新的「真不困」也做到第10期了，感恩初代困友们对我们的包容和陪伴。谨以此期诚意满满的年终盘点祝大家：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>新！年！快！乐！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【2023年终盘点提纲】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="36">00:36</a> 推荐一部年度影视文学作品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="777">12:57</a> 年度大事件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1465">24:25</a> 今年养成的好习惯和戒掉的坏习惯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2222">37:02</a> 选一个年度之友并送出祝福</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2461">41:01</a> 一个感叹命运的瞬间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3273">54:33</a> 用一种食物、一首歌、一支酒、一部电影展望2024</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎困友们在评论区留下你们的答案~</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>本期提到的影视文学作品：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>《何处是我朋友的家》阿巴斯·基亚罗斯塔米</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>《疾速追杀》（John Wick) 大卫·雷奇</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>《哈利·波特》</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>《倦怠社会》《妥协社会》韩炳哲</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>《被讨厌的勇气》岸见一郎、古贺史健</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>《要钱还是要生活》维姬·罗宾</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>《习惯的力量》查尔斯·杜希格</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>《掌控习惯》詹姆斯·克利尔</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>《封神》乌尔善</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>《美丽新世界》赫胥黎</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>BGM：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>Wendy Carlos - March from a Clockwork Orange (Ninth Symphony, Fourth Movement) [Abridged]</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>Francisco Canaro - Poema</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>Le Castle Vania - Osaka Phonk</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>John-Williams《哈利·波特》电影配乐</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>周杰伦-稻香</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>Phil Coulter-Sunlight On The Water</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>TizzyT-飞船失事</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】K总（白日梦KIIIIIly），奶总（李牛奶19），柯总（啊柯柯柯）。</span></p>]]></description>
