  <item>
    <title>07. 你当我是花瓶，那我只能亮出花臂 | 爹味饭局</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6524c6b250cf691d24555672</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6524c6b250cf691d24555672</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 10 Oct 2023 03:36:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>困友们，久等啦！</span></p><p><span>憋了这么久，当然是因为这集“电子榨菜”非常入味。</span></p><p><strong><span>本着说破无妨的态度，我们展开聊了聊“爹味饭局”。</span></strong></p><p><span>是躲是挡还是硬刚？欢迎困友们留言支招！</span></p><p><span>同时，本集最后有“性转版”饭局招募，不要错过~</span></p><p><span>*PTSD预警：本集含有大量爹味饭局细节。</span></p><p><em><span>【时间线】</span></em></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="54">00:54</a> 什么是爹味的饭局？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">02:10</a> 女性是花瓶还是菜，爹味的饭局为什么让人不适？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="244">04:04</a> 爹味是如何形成的？他们在日常生活和饭局上判若两人？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="591">09:51</a> 爹味一定是男性吗？有没有“女爹”？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="895">14:55</a> 爹味要素一——“越难喝的酒，才越叫酒。”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1097">18:17</a> 爹味要素二——权利差下的单口相声</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 爹味要素三——把饭局上的表现视作工作能力的一部分</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1357">22:37</a> 酒局控量小妙招</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1580">26:20</a> 长得帅的Daddy可以让人舒服一点吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1615">26:55</a> 爹味表演的底层也许是治愈自卑</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1903">31:43</a> 遇到“妹妹，加个微信？”怎么办？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1949">32:29</a> 不当花瓶就要亮出花臂</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2366">39:26</a> 不Girly的服装也能熏出爹味（本集最大心理阴影）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2522">42:02</a> 除了拒绝出席，还有什么办法可以改变爹味饭局？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2565">42:45</a> “性转版”饭局招募开启，报名方式：</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpcb_7cmuFCtdTyRHiV2JHSeemfY.JPG"></figure><p><strong><em><span>BGM：</span></em></strong></p><p><em><span>Raffaella Carrá - Rumore</span></em></p><p><em><span>Nicholas Britell - Satyricon - Instrumental</span></em></p><p><em><span>Nicholas Britell - Pianos + 808 + Beat - _Welcome Home”</span></em></p><p><em><span>Sam Smith; Kim Petras - Unholy</span></em></p><p><em><span>Shygirl - Wildfire</span></em></p><p><span>【主播】K总（白日梦KIIIIIly），奶总（李牛奶19），柯总（啊柯柯柯）。</span></p>]]></description>
